#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  App Sandboxing Engine
#  File: app_sandboxing_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS sandboxing engine responsible for:
#      • permission enforcement
#      • syscall filtering
#      • resource quota limits
#      • isolation profiles
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Sandbox Profiles](ca://s?q=Explain_Sandbox_Profiles)
#    - [Permission Enforcement](ca://s?q=Explain_Permission_Enforcement)
#    - [Syscall Filtering](ca://s?q=Explain_Syscall_Filtering)
#    - [Resource Quotas](ca://s?q=Explain_Resource_Quotas)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_profile(name, rules)
#         Registers a sandbox profile.
#
#    - create(app_id, profile)
#         Creates sandbox instance for an app.
#
#    - check(sandbox_id, permission)
#         Checks permission access.
#
#    - syscall(sandbox_id, call)
#         Validates syscall against profile.
#
#    - quota(sandbox_id, resource, amount)
#         Enforces resource limits.
#
#    - destroy(sandbox_id)
#         Destroys sandbox instance.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full sandbox state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  PROFILE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "permissions": ["network", "filesystem.read"],
#      "syscalls": ["open", "read", "write"],
#      "quotas": {
#         "cpu": 0.25,
#         "memory": 256,
#         "disk": 1024
#      }
#    }
#
